{"slug":"a-lover-letter-to-madison","title":"A Lover Letter to Madison","subtitle":"","date":"2026-06-01T13:31:32.544Z","wordcount":286,"coverImage":"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gPXx!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48047603-2ef3-47e4-a796-69b912135d3c_1200x1600.jpeg","url":"https://charlesallenkotula.substack.com/p/a-lover-letter-to-madison","html":"<p>Dear Madison,</p><p>It’s over. </p><p>It’s time to move on.</p><p>I’ll always love your sunsets—the way they forced me to confront myself, to fall helplessly into a well of emotion and remind me what it means to be human: the love, the heartbreak, the joy, the terror, the ecstasy, the depression. </p><p>Sometimes, felt separate. Sometimes, all at once. </p><p>But it wasn’t just your sunsets. </p><p>It was your trees, your lakes, your birds, your snow, your rain, and, most of all, your people. Everything a mirror—revealing all of me, even that which I didn’t wish to see. </p><p>You’ve shown me what I want. </p><p>Now it’s time to go get it.</p><p>So, it’s goodbye for now.</p><p>I hope our paths cross again someday.</p><p>Love,</p><p>Charlie</p><div><hr /></div><p><em><strong>Charlie x Madison: 2020-2026</strong></em></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!S9OP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fca8a89c9-fd5c-468f-9071-d1f7199ecdf2_1200x1600.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><figcaption><em><strong>2020 - Freshman - “Cooking” (sous vide cooler—shoutout dad)</strong></em></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Lkwb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbba82f34-1d47-417a-a30d-97cfc574dad2_1200x1600.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><figcaption><em><strong>2020 - Freshman - Dorm view</strong></em></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!zi1Q!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F776c42d8-3e75-49cf-9c1e-4989a21cf7d6_1200x1600.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><figcaption><em><strong>2021 - Sophomore - COVID Lifting</strong></em></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!T89Y!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F36b9268b-5a4f-4b13-8654-d4eaae2211d9_1200x1600.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><figcaption><em><strong>2021 - Sophomore - Proof of wearing non-pajama clothes (verified by Alisa)</strong></em></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!gPXx!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F48047603-2ef3-47e4-a796-69b912135d3c_1200x1600.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><figcaption><em><strong>2022 - Junior - 5:26 AM at Lake Mendota</strong></em></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!qpKh!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2168a11b-3a1b-42a3-8195-f25f74137874_812x1012.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div><figcaption><em><strong>2022 - Junior - The BJJ Beginnings</strong></em></figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!aYX9!,w